    text: "To mine a rock, simply interact with it while holding a pickaxe you have the level to use and you'll start mining it. Eventually, you'll collect the ore and the rock will deplete. Low-level rocks will replenish themselves fairly quickly, but higher-level ones will take longer and longer to come back.",
